        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11",
                "key": "e1f2a3b4-1111-4000-c001-000000000001",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "richtext",
                    "culture": "en-US",
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003E1. Introduction\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome to \u003Cstrong\u003EuTPro\u003C/strong\u003E (Umbraco Turbo Pro). By accessing this website, you agree to these terms.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E2. Acceptance\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBy using the website, you confirm you have read and agree to these Terms.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E3. Intellectual Property\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll content is property of uTPro. No copying or commercial use without permission.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E4. Permitted Use\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou \u003Cstrong\u003Emust not\u003C/strong\u003E: violate laws, unauthorized access, distribute malware, collect info illegally, use bots.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E5. Disclaimer\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProvided \u0022as-is\u0022 without guarantees.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E6. Liability\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro is not liable for indirect damages.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E7. Third-Party Links\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENot responsible for external content.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E8. Changes\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe may modify terms anytime.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E9. Governing Law\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGoverned by Vietnam law.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E10. Contact\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUse our Contact page.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
