                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003E1. Collection\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBrowser info, cookies, form submissions.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E2. Usage\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EImprove experience, analyze traffic, security, contact.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E3. Security\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe protect your information with appropriate measures.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E4. Cookies\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe use cookies. Customize in browser settings.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E5. Your Rights\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAccess, correct, delete data; object to processing; withdraw consent.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003E6. Sharing\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENo selling/sharing except as required by law.\u003C/p\u003E"
